WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.084 --> 00:00:02.210
The great Adrian Monk.

00:00:02.210 --> 00:00:05.588
For a while there, you were
solving a major case every week.

00:00:05.588 --> 00:00:06.715
I couldn't have done it alone.

00:00:07.549 --> 00:00:10.010
I could have, but it
would have taken longer.

00:00:12.721 --> 00:00:14.848
I have traumatic symptoms,
unprecedented in psychiatric history.

00:00:16.683 --> 00:00:19.686
He's afraid of heights. It’s his
second biggest fear after germs.

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:23.023
Actually, it goes germs,
needles, birds, then heights.

00:00:24.357 --> 00:00:26.067
That was no accident. He was murdered.

00:00:26.067 --> 00:00:27.444
You have to help me.

00:00:27.861 --> 00:00:29.529
Turn, turn it, turn it, turn it!

00:00:29.988 --> 00:00:31.031
There's a bomb!

00:00:31.031 --> 00:00:32.991
I know there’s a bomb! You’re not helping!

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:34.784
We should leave a note.

00:00:36.995 --> 00:00:38.079
When COVID hit, I was in bad shape.

00:00:38.079 --> 00:00:39.080
This is mine.

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:41.750
Look at us.

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:42.667
Everybody's you.

00:00:43.334 --> 00:00:44.753
They're gonna hate it.

00:00:45.253 --> 00:00:46.212
Here's what happened.

00:00:46.838 --> 00:00:48.631
So how does that feel to be working again?

00:00:48.631 --> 00:00:49.049
Ah!

00:00:49.049 --> 00:00:50.300
Like riding a bicycle.

00:00:51.926 --> 00:00:52.844
Ah!

00:00:52.844 --> 00:00:53.970
I'm glad to hear that.

00:00:53.970 --> 00:00:55.388
I mean, it's terrifying.

